<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Jan trade deficit surges to $3.48 bln.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Jan trade deficit surges to $3.48 bln.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's customs-cleared trade deficit hit a monthly record of $3.48 billion in January, provisional trade ministry figures showed on Saturday.</p>
<p>This compares with a $2.13 billion shortfall a year earlier and the previous monthly record deficit of $3.28 billion set last August.</p>
<p>					   Jan    Dec 96    Jan 96</p>
<p>    Trade balance		 -3,484    -1,369    -2,132</p>
<p>    FOB Exports		    9,108    12,211     9,923</p>
<p>    CIF Imports		   12,592    13,580    12,055</p>
<p>NOTE: in millions of dollars, December 1996 figures revised</p>
</text>
